WEBVTT

00:10:25.245 --> 00:10:31.502
(Applause)

00:10:31.502 --> 00:10:33.504
I wonder, you know, I've seen it.

00:10:33.545 --> 00:10:37.633
I saw people telling me that they
heard story, and like a podcast.

00:10:37.675 --> 00:10:40.010
But I wonder, how would
they feel about it?

00:10:40.010 --> 00:10:42.096
You know, I wanted the feedback from them.

00:10:42.137 --> 00:10:44.556
So I got a permit to go back into prison.

00:10:44.598 --> 00:10:48.018
And this time I said, let me work
on some more walls, I'll find an idea.

00:10:48.769 --> 00:10:51.855
So I go back in there
and I started working on the walls,

00:10:51.897 --> 00:10:55.109
but it was really, the excuse was like,
I need to speak to you guys.

00:10:55.150 --> 00:10:56.777
So I said, "What happened, guys?"

00:10:56.777 --> 00:10:59.405
They were like, "Well, what do
you mean, what happened?"

00:10:59.446 --> 00:11:02.491
I was like, "I was on the outside,
I couldn't speak to you guys.